 HTTP cookies across Android, iOS, and Desktop platforms.\r\n\r\n- Added `Cookie` data class to represent cookie properties.\r\n- Added `CookieManager` expect class with `setCookie`, `getCookies`, and `removeAllCookies` methods.\r\n- Implemented `CookieManager` for Android using `android.webkit.CookieManager`.\r\n- Implemented `CookieManager` for iOS using `WKHTTPCookieStore`.\r\n- Implemented `CookieManager` for Desktop using `java.net.CookieManager`.\r\n- Added no-op `CookieManager` implementations for JS and WasmJS.\r\n- Exposed `cookieManager` through the `WebView` interface and its platform-specific implementations.\r\n- Updated the sample `WebViewScreen` to demonstrate cookie management.","labels":[],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-03-16T16:48:49Z","updated_at":"2026-03-16T16:48:58Z","closed_at":"2026-03-16T16:48:57Z","merged_at":"2026-03-16T16:48:57Z","merge_commit_sha":"5daaa3dd6329103533a2a496b7fe3cee2ff28e19","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"MohamedRejeb:feature/web-cookie-management","ref":"feature/web-cookie-management","repo":{"id":674932206,"node_id":"R_kgDOKDql7g","name":"Calf","full_name":"MohamedRejeb/Calf","owner":{"login":"MohamedRejeb","id":41842296,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQxODQyMjk2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/41842296?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MohamedRejeb","html_url":"https://github.com/MohamedRejeb","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MohamedRejeb/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MohamedRejeb/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MohamedRejeb/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MohamedRejeb/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MohamedRejeb/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MohamedRejeb/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MohamedRejeb/